AI AGENTS

An AI Agent is an AI system that can reason about a goal, decide what actions are needed, use tools, observe results and continue until the task is completed.

Traditional chatbot:

Question → Answer

Agent:

Goal
 ↓
Reason
 ↓
Plan
 ↓
Tool
 ↓
Observe
 ↓
Reason
 ↓
Tool
 ↓
Result
Example

User:

Find the cheapest flight to Hyderabad and compare it with trains.

Agent might:

Search flights
Search trains
Compare prices
Compare duration
Recommend the best option
